{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0096-s001", "text": "I Finland behövs ett recept för många mediciner.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0096-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.388571428571429, "peak": 0.243316650390625, "generation_seconds": 10.373767517972738, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:38:48.433323+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0096-s002", "text": "En läkare skriver ut ett recept på medicin på mottagningen elektroniskt, vilket innebär att det sparas i den nationella receptdatabasen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0096-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.354557823129252, "peak": 0.343353271484375, "generation_seconds": 35.77178927999921, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:39:22.015699+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
2026-11-03T03:39:55.603657+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0096-s003", "text": "När patienten går till apoteket, kan farmaceuten kontrollera receptet med hjälp av hens F P A-kort, identitetskort eller körkort.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0096-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.42421768707483, "peak": 0.41107177734375, "generation_seconds": 41.82600008510053, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:40:29.189856+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0096-s004", "text": "Patienten kan köpa sina mediciner på vilket apotek som helst i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0096-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.30157470703125, "generation_seconds": 31.686839604983106, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:41:02.799230+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0096-s005", "text": "Värkmediciner liksom andra mediciner säljs inte i mataffärerna, utan endast på apoteken.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0096-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.3177490234375, "generation_seconds": 32.775182290002704, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:41:36.381882+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0097-s001", "text": "Den offentliga munhälsovården i Finland omfattar två typer av vård: förebyggande och korrigerande vård.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0097-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.891700680272109, "peak": 0.253936767578125, "generation_seconds": 44.798612299142405, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:42:09.967742+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
2026-11-03T03:42:39.968574+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0097-s002", "text": "Förebyggande vård betyder att munnens och tändernas hälsa upprätthålls med god egenvård, det vill säga daglig munrengöring hemma och regelbundna kontroller hos en yrkesperson inom munhälsa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0097-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 15.116190476190477, "peak": 0.284423828125, "generation_seconds": 59.08989580790512, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:43:13.574176+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0098-s001", "text": "Inom den korrigerande vården åtgärdar och behandlar en tandläkare befintliga skador och besvär.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0098-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.31768798828125, "generation_seconds": 31.27565242117271, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:43:47.204453+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0098-s002", "text": "I Finland får man om man vill alltid smärtlindring vid olika vårdåtgärder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0098-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.826666666666667, "peak": 0.373291015625, "generation_seconds": 24.553109167842194, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:44:20.746817+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0098-s003", "text": "Vid till exempel plombering får patienten först ytbedövning i munslemhinnan och därefter lokalbedövning i form av en injektion.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0098-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.727619047619047, "peak": 0.26263427734375, "generation_seconds": 39.52263125497848, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:44:54.364004+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0099-s001", "text": "På en offentlig hälsostation kan man få tid till tandläkare och tandhygienist.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0099-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.27667236328125, "generation_seconds": 29.5770828879904, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:45:27.918073+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0099-s002", "text": "I en del välfärdsområden kan det finnas en särskild tandvårdsklinik.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0099-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.22491455078125, "generation_seconds": 27.48558131302707, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:46:01.507806+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0099-s003", "text": "Tandhygienisten ger förebyggande mun- och tandvård och gör tandkontroller.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0099-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.266082763671875, "generation_seconds": 25.18812637985684, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:46:35.090854+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0099-s004", "text": "Tandläkaren lagar tänder och åtgärdar bettet och andra tandproblem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0099-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.990748299319728, "peak": 0.338409423828125, "generation_seconds": 23.18974642502144, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0099-s005", "text": "Det är ofta kö till den offentliga tandvården.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0099-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.179591836734694, "peak": 0.268096923828125, "generation_seconds": 15.35006125899963, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:47:08.683756+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0100-s001", "text": "Jouren betjänar människor som behöver brådskande vård.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0100-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.225982666015625, "generation_seconds": 19.69438673881814, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:47:42.263593+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0100-s002", "text": "Ett brådskande behov är till exempel om en tand värker eller lossnar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0100-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.339047619047619, "peak": 0.291961669921875, "generation_seconds": 22.37775650806725, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:48:15.850420+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0100-s003", "text": "Den anställda i tidsbokningen bedömer per telefon hur brådskande behovet av tandvård är.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0100-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.662585034013605, "peak": 0.28460693359375, "generation_seconds": 26.669727716129273, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:48:49.433671+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0100-s004", "text": "Om det behövs en tandkirurg för vården av tänderna, bokas först en tid till en vanlig tandläkare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0100-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.498503401360544, "peak": 0.250244140625, "generation_seconds": 30.227389208972454, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0100-s005", "text": "Hen skriver vid behov en remiss till specialisttandvården.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0100-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.238250732421875, "generation_seconds": 19.095592664089054, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:49:23.020419+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0101-s001", "text": "Munhälsovården för barn under 18 år är avgiftsfri på offentliga hälsostationer och tandvårdskliniker.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0101-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.752380952380953, "peak": 0.274017333984375, "generation_seconds": 33.374407057184726, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:49:56.606153+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0101-s002", "text": "För barn ordnas regelbundna kontroller av munhälsan när de är i daghems- och skolåldern.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0101-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.25244140625, "generation_seconds": 27.772614046931267, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:50:30.193364+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0101-s003", "text": "Syftet med vården för barn och unga är att säkerställa att de har en god mun- och tandhälsa redan från början.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0101-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.613061224489796, "peak": 0.266204833984375, "generation_seconds": 32.009837039979175, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:51:00.194632+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0102-s001", "text": "Om ett barn har ett funktionellt bettfel och uppfyller kriterierna för vård, hänvisas hen till tandreglering.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0102-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.264761904761905, "peak": 0.281097412109375, "generation_seconds": 32.012160851154476, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:51:33.777002+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
2026-11-03T03:52:07.362835+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0102-s002", "text": "Tandreglering som korrigerar bettfel är avgiftsfri för barn under 18 år på social- och hälsovårdscentralerna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0102-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.518639455782314, "peak": 0.248748779296875, "generation_seconds": 38.39295193715952, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0103-s001", "text": "Man kan också besöka en privattandläkare för att kontrollera munhälsan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0103-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.478367346938776, "peak": 0.416839599609375, "generation_seconds": 21.98588452907279, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:52:40.974194+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0103-s002", "text": "F P A ersätter en del av avgiften för privattandläkare om man har ett F P A-kort.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0103-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.35333251953125, "generation_seconds": 25.063899538945407, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:53:14.535689+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0103-s003", "text": "Om man inte har något kort, kan man ansöka om ersättning hos F P A i efterhand.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0103-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.409576416015625, "generation_seconds": 23.88652972294949, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:53:48.116537+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0103-s004", "text": "Man får vanligtvis snabbt en tid hos privattandläkare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0103-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.015510204081632, "peak": 0.3367919921875, "generation_seconds": 15.172579199075699, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0104-s001", "text": "På läkemedelsförpackningen står det sista användningsdatumet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0104-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.3243408203125, "generation_seconds": 15.765000206185505, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:54:21.706394+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0104-s002", "text": "Om läkemedlet har föråldrats kan det inte längre användas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0104-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.28326416015625, "generation_seconds": 17.70085419388488, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:54:55.288866+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0104-s003", "text": "Släng inte föråldrade läkemedel utan lämna dem alltid till apoteket (apteekki), eftersom de är problemavfall.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0104-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.404081632653062, "peak": 0.347198486328125, "generation_seconds": 34.69050590693951, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:55:28.878587+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0105-s001", "text": "På apoteket kan du byta ut det läkemedel som föreskrivs på receptet mot ett annat, förmånligare läkemedel om det verksamma ämnet är detsamma i båda preparaten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0105-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.235374149659863, "peak": 0.37017822265625, "generation_seconds": 46.67248065001331, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:56:02.463299+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0105-s002", "text": "Den anställda på apoteket berättar för kunden om det finns ett billigare alternativ.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0105-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.38006591796875, "generation_seconds": 18.262970196083188, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:56:36.047004+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0106-s001", "text": "Vissa läkemedel kan du ta med dig från utlandet till Finland för eget bruk.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0106-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.478367346938776, "peak": 0.31427001953125, "generation_seconds": 14.435121329966933, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0106-s002", "text": "Importen är dock begränsad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0106-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.8560544217687074, "peak": 0.32513427734375, "generation_seconds": 7.177974566817284, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:57:09.633356+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0106-s003", "text": "Begränsningarna beror på vilken sorts läkemedel det är fråga om och från vilket land du tar med dig läkemedlet till Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0106-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.327728271484375, "generation_seconds": 28.270890948129818, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T03:57:43.299251+00:00 hb-c10-lakemedel tts: PID 121753 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0106-s004", "text": "Du måste också till exempel med ett recept eller ett läkarintyg kunna bevisa att läkemedlet är avsett för eget bruk.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0106-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.47374149659864, "peak": 0.31768798828125, "generation_seconds": 25.274353872053325, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0107-s001", "text": "Ta reda på begränsningarna innan du för in läkemedel i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-lakemedel/narration/hb-c10-u0107-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.23345947265625, "generation_seconds": 13.849047985160723, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
